why: '満腹百合. Its seven episodes split 3 browser-readable and 4 carrying `アプリで読める` on

  their own tile, which is the shape most of this platform is in: the opening chapters
  read free in a

  browser and the rest moved into the phone app.


  THE HEADER IS THE COUNTER-CASE AND NOT PADDING. `meta_info` states the work-level
  badge, and a rule

  reading app-only off it would call all seven app-only and be wrong about three.
  The label is read

  per episode because this page shows both answers at once.'
